It is a good idea to see a doctor to see if you suffer from sinuses or any middle ear problem
But if there is no problem, and prostration causes you inconvenience, then you can pray while sitting on a chair or not prolong the prostration.
God Almighty said: {And He has not placed upon you in religion any difficulty}

Statin therapy is the ideal treatment to control high blood cholesterol and must be continued for the period prescribed by the doctor, and it must not be stopped. Among the side effects that the drug may cause:
headache;
Mild muscle pain;
Arthritis;
Back pain;
mild nausea;
stomach pain or indigestion;
Constipation, or
Sleep problems (insomnia).
However, these effects do not necessarily occur, and if they do occur, you must consult a doctor
